EASA Easy Access Rules
----------------------

Copyright European Union Aviation Safety Agency.

Reproduction is authorised provided the source is acknowledged, per EASA's
copyright policy: https://www.easa.europa.eu/copyright-disclaimer

Easy Access Rules are consolidated, easy-to-read compilations. EASA states in
the publications themselves that they are not official publications and that
EASA accepts no liability for their use. The authoritative texts are the
Certification Specifications and the Executive Director Decisions that
introduce or amend them.

Always verify critical interpretations against the official EASA publication.
This toolkit is unofficial and is not endorsed by EASA.


14 CFR (FAA)
------------

Title 14 of the Code of Federal Regulations is a work of the United States
Government and is in the public domain. It is retrieved from the eCFR API
(https://www.ecfr.gov). The eCFR is an editorial compilation; the Federal
Register and the annual CFR edition are the authoritative sources.

This toolkit is not a source for the FAA certification basis. It mirrors
regulation text only — no Advisory Circulars, policy or preamble material.


Storage
-------

No regulatory text is stored in this repository. `tests/real_samples/` contains
only pins (download URL, version label, sha256, size); the publications are
fetched on demand by `tests/real_samples/fetch_samples.py` and verified against
those hashes.
